  "body": "matrix-org/matrix-react-sdk#3500 is awesome, but currently relies on riot-web's config.json to find out what permalink prefix to use.  this sucks for other clients (e.g. riot-ios or riot/android or others) which might connect to the server and need to know what prefix to intercept the links in-app.\r\n\r\nWe can't use matrix URLs for this given the use case for custom permalink prefixes is unfederated deployments, so instead we should specify a way via /info or similar to advertise the prefix that server recommends.",
